---
// Banda diferenciadora. El form en Fase 1 redirige a /diagnostico con el texto.
---

<section class="diag grid-bg">
  <div class="diag-glow-1"></div>
  <div class="diag-glow-2"></div>

  <div class="wrap" data-reveal>
    <span class="badge">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="#0EA5E9" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9z"/></svg>
      Novedad — Diagnóstico Inteligente
    </span>

    <h2>¿No sabes exactamente qué necesitas?<br/><span class="gradient-text">Descríbelo en tus propias palabras.</span></h2>
    <p class="sub">Nuestra IA clasifica tu necesidad, identifica prioridades y crea un ticket en segundos.</p>

    <form class="diag-form" id="diag-form">
      <textarea
        id="diag-input"
        placeholder='Ej: "Tengo una parcela en Los Ángeles sin internet, quiero cámaras y saber si Starlink funciona allá..."'
        rows="3"
      ></textarea>
      <button type="submit" class="btn-primary diag-btn">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9z"/></svg>
        Analizar mi caso
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </button>
    </form>

    <div class="diag-trust">
      <span>✓ Sin costo</span>
      <span>✓ Sin compromiso</span>
      <span>✓ Respuesta en menos de 2h</span>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="diag-quote">
      💬 "Nos escribió sin saber qué necesitaba. Diagnosticamos e instalamos Starlink + cámaras en 1 semana."
      <cite>— Mario A., dueño de parcela · Región del Maule</cite>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .diag {
    padding: 100px 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #060B17 0%, #0A1428 50%, #060B17 100%);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .diag-glow-1 { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 20%; width: 500px; height: 500px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(14,165,233,0.1) 0%, transparent 65%); pointer-events: none; }
  .diag-glow-2 { position: absolute; bottom: 0; right: 15%; width: 400px; height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(129,140,248,0.08) 0%, transparent 65%); pointer-events: none; }

  .wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(14,165,233,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(14,165,233,0.3);
    border-radius: 100px; padding: 7px 16px;
    font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: #7DD3FC;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .diag h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.15; }
  .sub { color: var(--c-text-muted); font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 18px 0 36px; }

  .diag-form {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;
    max-width: 660px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  textarea {
    width: 100%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(14,165,233,0.25);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    resize: vertical;
    min-height: 110px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  textarea::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); }
  textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(14,165,233,0.12); }
  .diag-btn { align-self: center; padding: 15px 32px; font-size: 1rem; }

  .diag-trust { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 22px; color: var(--c-text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; }

  .diag-quote {
    margin: 48px auto 0; max-width: 600px;
    padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-style: italic; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .diag-quote cite { display: block; margin-top: 10px; font-style: normal;
    font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--c-text-muted); }

  @media (max-width: 680px) { .diag { padding: 64px 24px; } }
</style>

<script>
  // Fase 1: redirige a /diagnostico llevando el texto como query param.
  // En Fase 3 este mismo input lo procesa el agente IA.
  const form = document.getElementById('diag-form');
  form?.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    const input = document.getElementById('diag-input') as HTMLTextAreaElement | null;
    const text = encodeURIComponent(input?.value.trim() || '');
    window.location.href = `/diagnostico${text ? `?q=${text}` : ''}`;
  });
</script>
